From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 21:27:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add two-stage OpenRouter idea engine with per-step AI images

- Secure AI gateway: Supabase edge function (ai-gateway) + Vite dev middleware sharing one core; key stays server-side
- Ideate (8 scored concepts, top 3 distinct archetypes) then develop (full numeric build manual, validate + repair)
- Per-project and per-step AI images with consistent visual bible, cached in IndexedDB, lazy generation
- Project page shows rich materials/tools/steps/checkpoints/troubleshooting; saves strip heavy images (516KB -> 18KB)
- Falls back to legacy generators with a visible notice

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
